CHAPTER.VERS:
For he is our God, And we are the people of his pasture, and the sheep of his hand. Today, oh that you

          {+}
         would hear his voice!

Do not harden your

          {+}
         heart, as at Meribah, As in the day of Massah in the wilderness;

When your

          {+}
         fathers tried me, Proved me, and saw my work.
